{"text": "4\n\n2)\n\n3,\n\n4}\n\n8\n\nNEWPORT FLOOR MAT - QUESTIONNAIRE\n\nWas this item accepted by Retail Accounts?\nYes, retailers were very willing to allow placement.\n\nWhat were it's Strengths?\n\u2018The mat is large and very bright. It communicated very\nclearly Newport's message.\n\nWhat were its Weaknesses?\nThe mat could be difficult to remove after it has become worn.\nThere is also some concern about the message we are sending\nbby allowing customers to wipe their feet on Newport.\n\nWas it effective in communicating Newports' Brand Image?\nYes, It stands out. The announcement is very bold.\n\nWhere {specifically} was it placed at Retail?\nRetail accounts with highly developed menthol business in\nfront of counters, carton fixtures and store entrances.\n\nDo you recommend we use this item as an Excel Plan P.O.S.\nQualifier {P-1, P-5, C-5} oF as a piece not attached to an Excel Plan\n\u2018or do not produce it at all?\n\u2018This could be a productive piece but it should not be\n\u2018attached to an excel plan.\n\nOTHER COMMENTS\n\u2018The mat should have placement guidelines that include,\n\u2018but are not limited to the floor.\n\nReturn to M. Tahmaseb by\n\nNEWPORTR.OORMATQUESTIONARE-18 July 31, 1998\n\n\u2018Ss\n\nol\no\n\n166968", "words": [{"text": "4", "x0": 109, "y0": 163, "x1": 119, "y1": 176, "conf": 42.0}, {"text": "2)", "x0": 106, "y0": 256, "x1": 118, "y1": 269, "conf": 63.0}, {"text": "3,", "x0": 106, "y0": 348, "x1": 118, "y1": 361, "conf": 43.0}, {"text": "4}", "x0": 106, "y0": 441, "x1": 118, "y1": 454, "conf": 42.0}, {"text": "8", "x0": 105, "y0": 644, "x1": 117, "y1": 656, "conf": 54.0}, {"text": "NEWPORT", "x0": 139, "y0": 103, "x1": 242, "y1": 117, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "FLOOR", "x0": 249, "y0": 103, "x1": 319, "y1": 117, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "MAT", "x0": 326, "y0": 103, "x1": 369, "y1": 117, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "-", "x0": 372, "y0": 99, "x1": 385, "y1": 127, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "QUESTIONNAIRE", "x0": 390, "y0": 103, "x